                        "entry_id": "9c037efd-1db4-3afd-bda0-287f2da3a7c2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "As much as fills a chapter."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "72b80900-d8f5-4925-ae36-7cc5fb692a65",
                                "sense_id": "90bccfa7-e29e-3391-8e58-68034d39293c",
                                "text": "He cites two chaptersful of specific instances of wasted civilian and uniformed manpower and of waste in procurement of supplies which, if eliminated, would save $3,110,000,000."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bae82ce-73d0-462b-8f86-c7780a40e104",
                                "sense_id": "90bccfa7-e29e-3391-8e58-68034d39293c",
                                "text": "Only a rough sketch will be attempted here—partly because this topic could fill up a book of its own and partly because the author does not have a bookful or even a chapterful of ideas on the subject."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7d33d49-03ac-4149-931f-5efda0fed060",
                                "sense_id": "90bccfa7-e29e-3391-8e58-68034d39293c",
                                "text": "It’s a compilation of the history and lore of wild rice, nutrition information, preparation and serving suggestions, and chaptersful of recipes divided according to dishes suitable for the four seasons of the year."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "00f0db3e-a76b-4746-add1-a284a5988456",
                                "sense_id": "90bccfa7-e29e-3391-8e58-68034d39293c",
                                "text": "Seven sets of quilting instructions comprise chaptersful of homily, wisdom and reimagined American history: […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8ab63d87-1e56-45c1-8465-108f033a37e6",
                                "sense_id": "90bccfa7-e29e-3391-8e58-68034d39293c",
                                "text": "I never really discovered how to write this book. A year and more ago, it seemed a fairly simple undertaking. I already felt so much about poverty - I set out with chapterfuls of opinions and theories."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "de6f3df9-bc06-4fc3-8467-f7e130b737bd",
                                "sense_id": "90bccfa7-e29e-3391-8e58-68034d39293c",
                                "text": "Well, we have seen this kind of phenomenon before, and the long-suffering reader will now be expecting a chapterful of negative results on the finite base property for relation-type algebras."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
